":"不敲門就闖進別人的家，十分（  ）他人。","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每個人都有身體（  ），別人不能隨便碰觸或強迫。","n":24,"ssz":".1...................1.."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"性騷擾常發生在沒有旁人在場的地方，因此受害者往往難以（  ）。","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列語詞何者使用錯誤?","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"八卦新聞常是大家「茶餘飯後」聊天的話題","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這件賄選案一經媒體披露，輿論「譁然」","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他奉公守法，常幫助別人，絲毫不「忌憚」","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"開黃腔容易「冒犯」別人，使人不舒服","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據課文，性侵或性騷擾受害者有幾項不敢站出來舉報的理由，以下敘述何者為非？","n":37,"ssz":"....................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"怕自己變成八卦話題的主角","n":12,"ssz":"...........1"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"權力不對等，加害者權力位階較高","n":15,"ssz":"..1............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"難以舉證，擔心不被別人相信","n":13,"ssz":".......1...1."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"受害者在經濟或情感上依賴加害者","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"#MeToo運動希望帶來一些社會改變，以下敘述何者為非？","n":28,"ssz":"............2..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓受害者知道不是他的問題，停止內疚自責","n":19,"ssz":"......1...........